			"Message": "style(Vine): Remove blank line after function signatures in notification handlers\n\nRemove the extraneous blank line between function signatures and their bodies across all 27 notification handler files in Source/Client/ and Source/Server/Notification/. Each handler previously had a single empty line after the signature (e.g., `pub async fn HandlerName(...) {` followed by a blank line then the body). This normalizes formatting for consistent visual density.\n\nThe change affects the client publish notification handler and all 26 server-side gRPC notification handlers (extension lifecycle, output channels, progress, tree views, provider unregistration, webview, window, and workspace notifications). No functional behavior changes — purely whitespace normalization continuing the style cleanup from prior commits.",
			"SHA": "f8aebff2d66afde9b3257e3f6458a0ca5ae22b0d"
