			"Message": "style(Vine): Normalize whitespace in notification handlers and README emoji spacing\n\nAdd a blank line after function signatures across all 27 server notification handlers in Source/Server/Notification/ for consistent formatting. Each handler now has a visual separation between the signature and body.\n\nIn README.md, replace table-cell-separated emoji layout with inline narrow no-break spaces (&#x2001;) for Vine 🌿 and Land 🏞️ headers, and simplify the section heading spacing.\n\nNo functional changes — only whitespace and formatting normalization.",
			"SHA": "21ec9ad02de17b8e6184bc69cf4359e106fad293"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
