			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				2513,
				1
			],
			"Message": "style(Vine): Consolidate emoji icons into header text in README\n\nThe README header table previously used separate table cells for the Vine 🌿 and Land 🏞️ emoji icons. This change moves the emoji characters inline with their respective header text (\"Vine 🌿\" and \"Land 🏞️\"), removing the dedicated icon cells and simplifying the table structure.\n\nNo semantic content changes — only layout normalization for better readability.",
			"SHA": "3ef2c24761ff8561e68e5a9055212d5e5f096c8c"
		}
